# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Orc Horde, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 124.5 h -> 116.8 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: The Monogrammed Sash (8552), Message in a Bottle (594).
# 7 goals moved in from other guides of the chain.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 54-64) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Revantusk Village -> fly to the Undercity (Oran Snakewrithe) ->
# zeppelin to Orgrimmar -> fly to Splintertree Post -> ride into Azshara:
# Shadowsong Shrine -> Valormok (flight path) -> Kim'jael and the Thalassian
# Base Camp -> Ruins of Eldarath -> Kim'jael -> Valormok and Archmage Xylem ->
# fly to Orgrimmar -> zeppelin to Grom'gol -> Ironjaw basilisks -> Booty Bay ->
# fly to Grom'gol -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (turn-ins, training) -> Thunder
# Bluff (Druid and Paladin training) -> Camp Mojache (bind) -> the Muisek
# chain and Zorbin's coast -> hearth to Camp Mojache -> fly to Gadgetzan
# (bind) -> Broken Pillar, at the road
# into Un'Goro Crater, where the next guide starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Azshara is one loop (Shadowsong Shrine, Valormok, Kim'jael, the ruins,
#   Kim'jael, Valormok) instead of the export's back-and-forth between
#   Loh'atu and Sanath Lim-yo.
# - The two Stranglethorn stops (visits 55 and 57) are one: Grom'gol, the
#   basilisks and Booty Bay, then a flight back to Grom'gol for the zeppelin.
#   Its hearth and binds (Grom'gol, Booty Bay) are not needed.
# - The two Undercity stops (56, 61): Oran's turn-ins are done when you pass
#   the city at the start; Andron Gant (3542/3564), A Call to Arms (5094) and
#   Seeping Corruption (3568) move to the next guide's Undercity stop, which
#   the route passes on the way to the Plaguelands.
# - The Bulwark stop (60: 5096, 5405, 5407, 5408, 5901) moves to the next
#   guide, which rides past the Bulwark anyway; it saves an Undercity round trip.
# - Orgrimmar (59) is done when the zeppelin from Grom'gol brings you back,
#   before Feralas, and Thunder Bluff (62) on the flight to Camp Mojache, so no
#   city is visited twice.
# - Feralas: the Muisek chain first, then one trip to the north-west coast for
#   the giants and Zorbin (the export goes there twice).
# - Dropped: the Swamp of Sorrows stop (63: Return to Fel'Zerul 1444 and the
#   Fallen Hero chain 2784, 2621, 2622: two flights and a zeppelin for about
#   6,600 XP); Continued Threat (1428) was already turned in earlier.
# - Dropped: Message in a Bottle (594: a beach search and a swim to Jaguero
#   Isle for 2,900 XP), Slake That Thirst (379: needs Into the Field, which
#   the route no longer takes), Yuka Screwspigot (4324: a detour to
#   Steamwheedle Port), Deadmire (1205) and Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog (580:
#   never picked up earlier), A Sample of Slime... (4293: the slime comes from
#   Felwood, after which the route never returns to the Undercity),
#   Samophlange Manual (3924: its pages drop in the Barrens), The Spirits of
#   Stonetalon (1061: never turned in) and Vivian Lagrave (4133: needs level
#   50, and the only Undercity stop before Kargath comes at 49.5).
# - Thunder Bluff's and Grom'gol's binds are dropped (replaced unused); the
#   Camp Mojache and Gadgetzan binds are kept for their hearths.
# - Gadgetzan by air: Tran'rek beside the wind rider master, Pestlezugg and
#   Sprinkle first, then the inn and Marin on the south side, on the way out.
#
# Optional: Rescue OOX-22/FE! (2767), Rescue OOX-09/HL! (836) and Rescue
# OOX-17/TN! (648) if you
# escorted those robots, and An OOX of Your Own (3721), which needs all three
# robots home. A Meeting with the Master (3381) gives no experience, only a
# teleport to Azshara Tower.
#
# Left open for later guides: Jes'rimon's Payment to Jediga (3563),
# Magatha's Payment to Jediga (3562), Betrayed (3504), Bone-Bladed Weapons
# (4300), The Strength of Corruption (4120), Un'Goro Soil (3761), Super
# Sticky (4504), Bungle in the Jungle (4496), The Stone Circle (3444) and
# Delivery to Andron Gant (3542, the next guide's Undercity stop).
#
# Class quests: none here. The level-52 Hunter chain to Ogtinc in Azshara
# (The Hunter's Charm, 8151-8232) is a Class guide
# (forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm): its last part needs Morphaz in
# the Sunken Temple, and Forever took The Green Drake's (8232) reward
# choices away, so it pays experience only.

